WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.330
In 1967, a new law made
abortion legal in England,

2
00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:07.720
Wales and Scotland, if two doctors agree.

3
00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:12.700
Since 1990, the limit for most
grounds has been 24 weeks.

4
00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:18.320
In 2026, a new law meant women in England
and Wales could no longer be prosecuted

5
00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:20.580
for ending their own pregnancy.

6
00:00:20.630 --> 00:00:24.960
Pro-life and pro-choice campaigners
both say they value life.

7
00:00:25.010 --> 00:00:27.840
So why do they disagree so deeply?

8
00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:30.450
In this mission, you'll
learn what the law says,

9
00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:33.210
and the strongest arguments on each side.

10
00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:37.780
Then you'll read the Bible passages
Christians apply to life before birth,

11
00:00:37.830 --> 00:00:41.350
and see why Christians
and Humanists disagree.

12
00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:47.190
Your mission: find out why people who
all value life disagree so deeply about

13
00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:47.960
abortion.
